{"title":"Venom Gland","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Copperhead, Small Copperhead, Lizper Spitter, Lizper, Large Copperhead +2 more</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-quest\"><b>Quest item.</b> Asked for by Mother Sedge&#39;s Remedy.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"large-copperhead\" title=\"Large Copperhead - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/278a681cfd44055be411.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Large Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"lizper\" title=\"Lizper - dropped it in 24 of 31 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3765090b26ea5af52165.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"lizper-spitter\" title=\"Lizper Spitter - dropped it in 27 of 36 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3765090b26ea5af52165.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Spitter</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"small-copperhead\" title=\"Small Copperhead - dropped it in 107 of 164 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/79167631ab2fcb600a3d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–6</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra